# Sabor-app: menu data rules (DB + JSON fallback)

- Menu data can exist in two forms:
  - SQLite DB (main source for editing/admin)
  - menu-database.json (fallback and a source of extra fields)

- When changing menu item fields:
  - Keep DB and JSON fields consistent.
  - Do not drop extra wine/bar fields that come from JSON.

- If implementing import/rebuild:
  - Deduplicate items by id.
  - Preserve stable ordering where the UI expects it.

- Keep fallback behavior working: menu should still show if DB partially fails.